OL,3,GNEWSACheers all round as village gets
OL,4,Apub back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey village has celebrated the
OL,7,Freturn of its local pub.
OL,9,FWood Street Village near Guildford had
OL,10,Flost both of its boozers in recent
OL,11,Fyears, which sparked plans for a
OL,12,Fcommunity pub.
OL,14,FHowever, a new landlord Jeremy Gordeno
OL,15,Fhas reopened the White Hart after it
OL,16,Fhaving been shut for almost two years.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
