OL,3,GNEWSACheers all round as village gets
OL,4,Apub back
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard, who lives next door to the
OL,7,Fvenue, told BBC Radio Surrey the pub
OL,8,Fhad been "awfully missed", adding:
OL,9,F"It's been a sad sight with all the
OL,10,Fwindows boarded up and the concrete
OL,11,Fbarriers outside."
